    "text": "Her saga\u00f0 ymbe \u00fea halgan marian usses dryhtnes modor.\nMid \u00fey \u00fee dryhten h\u00e6lende crist for ealre worulde alysnesse on rode gef\u00e6stnod hangode he geseah under\n\u00dea bebead he him \u00fea halgan marian and him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feis is \u00fein modor, and \u00e6fter \u00feon he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to hire,\nAnd of \u00fe\u00e6re tide seo halie maria on Iohannes gymnesse \u00feurhwunode swa lange swa hio on \u00feissum life\nHw\u00e6t la he sende ure dryhten his apostolas geond ealne middangeard mancyn to l\u00e6ranne \u00fea s\u00e6t maria\n\u00d0y \u00feriddan geare \u00e6fter \u00feon \u00fee drihten crist in heofon astah \u00fea sume d\u00e6ge w\u00e6s hio to \u00feon swi\u00f0e\nAnd \u00fea sona geseah hio drihtnes engel hire \u00e6tstandende \u00f0a grette he hi and cw\u00e6\u00f0, hal wes \u00feu maria\nHw\u00e6t la, \u00feis palmtwig of niorhxwonge ic \u00fee brohte \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu gedo \u00fe\u00e6t he sie boren beforan \u00feinre b\u00e6re\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 maria to \u00feam engle, ic \u00fee bidde \u00fe\u00e6tte syn to me gesomnode ealle apostolas mines drihtnes\n\u00d0a andswarode hire se engel and cw\u00e6\u00f0, nu tod\u00e6ge hi beo\u00f0 genumene of neorhxnawonges gefean and\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 maria eft to \u00feam engle, ic \u00f0e bidde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu sende \u00feine bletsunge ofer me \u00fe\u00e6tte n\u00e6nig geweald\nSe engel me to cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fea ecean bletsunge \u00fee sealde \u00fein drihten godes \u00feeowa and \u00e6renddraca ic eom\nAnd se engel \u00fea mid micelre biorhtnesse \u00f0anon gewat and se palma scan swi\u00fee leohte and his leaf\nMaria hi \u00f0a gegirede mid hire selran gyrelan and hio genam \u00f0one palman \u00feone \u00fee hio of \u00f0\u00e6s engles\nAnd hie \u00fe\u00e6r geb\u00e6d and cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feancas ic \u00f0e dem \u00e6lmihtig domine ealles \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feu me to gemedomodest.\nIc n\u00e6s swa micelre weor\u00f0myndu weor\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me n\u00e6re mildsiende.\nAnd \u00fea \u00f0us cwe\u00f0ende in hire huse hio w\u00e6s gongende.\nMid \u00fey \u00f0e se halga iohannes l\u00e6rde \u00fe\u00e6t folc in effessum on sunnand\u00e6ge \u00e6t underntide \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea \u00feunorrada\nAnd he w\u00e6s ah\u00e6afen from \u00feara ymbstandendra eagum and he w\u00e6s aset beforan \u00f0\u00e6s huses dura \u00fe\u00e6r sio\nAnd hio cw\u00e6\u00f0 to iohanne, ic \u00f0e bidde min bearn iohannes \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00f0u wes gemindig \u00feines lareowes worda\nAnd ic gehyrde iudea ge\u00f0eahtunge hi cw\u00e6don, uton onbidan hw\u00e6nne \u00f0ios swelte \u00fe\u00e6t we m\u00e6gen hire\nAnd \u00f0a hio \u00feis gecweden h\u00e6fde hio him \u00e6teowde hire lichr\u00e6gl \u00fee hio of \u00f0\u00e6s engles handa onfeng and\nSe halga iohannes hire andwarode and cw\u00e6\u00f0, hu m\u00e6g ic \u00f0e ana gedefelice dea\u00f0\u00feenuga gegearwian\n\u00dea betweox \u00feas word ealle \u00fea apostolas w\u00e6ron of \u00feam stowum \u00fee hie \u00e6r l\u00e6rdon in wolcnum ahafen\nAnd in gongende hi gretton hi him betwunum and cw\u00e6don, for hwylcon \u00feingon gesamnode us drihten\nMid \u00fey hi \u00fe\u00e6t spr\u00e6con and hi to drihtne geb\u00e6don.\nIohannes se apostol cwom to him and he him s\u00e6de.\nIn gongende \u00fea apostolas gretton marian and cw\u00e6don, bio \u00feu gebletsod from dryhtne se geworhte\nHio him andswarode and cw\u00e6\u00f0, si drihtnes bletsung ofer eow and sib sie mid eow in drihtnes noman.\nNu \u00feonne mine \u00fea leofan bro\u00feor, secgea\u00f0 me, hu ge hider cwomon?\nHiere \u00f0a apostolas s\u00e6don ealle hu hiera anra gehwylc of \u00f0ere stowe \u00feyder com \u00fee he on l\u00e6rde.\nMaria him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, gebletsod sie drihten se gefylde mine gyrnesse and he me ne bescyrede eowerre\nAc he me forgeaf \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow licumlicum eagum gesio \u00e6r \u00feon \u00fee ic swelte and ic eow ealle bidde \u00fe\u00e6t\nHie ealle \u00fea hire geheton and mid hira wordum fredon and in godes hirnesse \u00f0urhwunedon.\nAnd \u00f0a samnunga \u00e6t underne sl\u00e6p com ofer ealle \u00fea \u00f0e w\u00e6ron in \u00feam huse swa \u00fe\u00e6tte n\u00e6nig wacian ne\nAnd \u00fea hra\u00fee com drihten mid micele engla werode and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam apostolum, sib sy mid eow.\nBro\u00feor \u00f0a andswaredon and cw\u00e6don, domine sy \u00fein mildheortnes ofer us swa we gehyhta\u00f0 in \u00f0e.\nMaria hi \u00fea astrehte in \u00f0one flor and hi to drihtne geb\u00e6d and cw\u00e6\u00f0, wes \u00feu min gemyndig wuldres\n\u00dea andswarode hire domine and cw\u00e6\u00f0, mid \u00fey \u00f0e ic sylf for mancynnes h\u00e6lo dea\u00f0 \u00ferowode \u00feystra\n\u00deu hine gesyh\u00f0 ac astih of \u00feinre reste and \u00feone gedefan ende \u00feines lifes gefyl for \u00feon \u00f0in bide\u00fe se\n\u00dee he domine \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0 heo astah ofer hire bedde and gode \u00feanciende hio onsende hire gast.\nAnd \u00fea apostolas gesawon \u00fe\u00e6re halgan marian sawle swa micle leohte scinende swa \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nig man\n\u00dea \u00e6tf\u00e6ste se h\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6re haligan marian saule michaele \u00feam heahengle se is neorxnawonges hyrde\nSwylce he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to petre, geheald \u00f0u marian lichoman and bringa\u00f0 hine in \u00fea swi\u00f0ran healfe \u00fe\u00e6re\nByrgea\u00f0 hi \u00fe\u00e6r and onbida\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r o\u00f0 \u00feone \u00feriddan d\u00e6g and ic hweorfe eft to eow.\nAnd he \u00f0a drihten mid sawle his modor and mid \u00feam halgum englum and in micelre beorhtnesse on\nHw\u00e6t la, \u00fea \u00fereo f\u00e6mnan genamon \u00feone lichoman \u00fe\u00e6re geadegan marian to \u00f0on \u00fe\u00e6t hi woldon hie\nMid \u00fey \u00fee hine ongiredon se haliga lichoma scean swa micele leohte \u00fe\u00e6tte he meahte wesan gesewen.\nHi hine \u00fea gegyredon mid hire lichr\u00e6gle and \u00f0a samnunga \u00fe\u00e6t leoht \u00feanon gewat and on ansine \u00fe\u00e6re\nAnd \u00f0a apostolas \u00fea gesetton \u00feone halgan lichoman in b\u00e6re and iohannes cw\u00e6\u00f0 to petre, \u00fee gedafena\u00f0\nPetrus him andswarode and cw\u00e6\u00f0, hw\u00e6t \u00feu nu wemmast for us ealle from drihtne eart gecoren for \u00f0on\nAnd \u00f0a he in rode gealgan gef\u00e6stnod hangode his \u00fey arf\u00e6stan mu\u00f0e \u00fee \u00feas \u00e6tf\u00e6ste for \u00f0on \u00feu \u00feisne\nIc bere \u00feisne halgan lichoman mid minum efnapostolum.\nPaulus cw\u00e6\u00f0, for \u00feon \u00fee ic eower ealra gingest eom in \u00fean apostolhade ic bere \u00fea b\u00e6re mid \u00fee.\nPetrus ahof \u00fea b\u00e6re \u00e6t \u00f0am heafdum, paulus \u00e6t \u00f0am fotum and petrus ongan singan and ealle \u00f0a\nEac swylce englas of heofnum him on efn sungon swa \u00fe\u00e6t eal seo eor\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s sanges wynsumnesse and\n\u00d0a \u00feis \u00f0a gehirdon \u00feara sacerda ealdormen \u00fea eodon hi mid micelre m\u00e6nigo of \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre and\nHim \u00fea w\u00e6s s\u00e6d maria is for\u00f0 feredo and cristes \u00f0egenas hire lichoman to byrgenne bera\u00f0 and \u00f0as\nMitte \u00fee \u00f0ara sacerda ealdormen \u00feis gehyrdon \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00fea apostolas hyhtende and singende eodon \u00fea\nHra\u00f0e his handa w\u00e6ron f\u00e6ste in \u00fe\u00e6re b\u00e6re and he hangode on \u00fe\u00e6re b\u00e6re swa he no eor\u00f0an \u00e6thran ac\nAnd \u00f0a apostolas eodon swi\u00f0e hyhtende domine.\nEnglas \u00fea w\u00e6ron in \u00fe\u00e6re b\u00e6re lyfte hi slogon \u00fe\u00e6t folc mid micelre blindnesse \u00fee of \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre ut\n\u00deara sacerda ealdorman se w\u00e6s f\u00e6st in \u00fe\u00e6re b\u00e6re he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to petre, ic \u00fee bidde \u00feu halga petrus \u00fe\u00e6t\nAc gemyne mid \u00fey \u00f0e sio duru\u00feiowen \u00fee hearm spece\u00f0 and \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6re dura wyrnde ic \u00fee w\u00e6s wel\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 him petrus, to gelyf in god \u00feone \u00feeos geb\u00e6r in hire inno\u00fee, \u00fe\u00e6t is drihten h\u00e6lende crist.\nPetrus het \u00fea b\u00e6re asettan and \u00feara sacerda ealdormon cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic gelyfe on godes sunu urne drihten\nAnd \u00fea sona his handa w\u00e6ron ungefele and \u00fe\u00e6t wite \u00fea git ne gewat from him.\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 him petrus, to gong to \u00feissum lichoman and cwe\u00f0, ic gelyfe in drihten h\u00e6lend \u00feone \u00feios geb\u00e6r\nMid \u00fey \u00f0e he \u00feus dide hra\u00f0e his h\u00e6lo him w\u00e6s agifen and he wuldrode drihten and herede god.\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 him petrus to, genim \u00feisne palman of iohannes handa and gong in \u00feas ceastre.\n\u00deonne gemetest \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6r micel folc ablended sete \u00feone palman ofer hira eagan and cwe\u00f0, gelyf in god\nAnd \u00f0onne swa hwylce swa gelyfan willa\u00f0 onfo\u00f0 gesyh\u00f0e, \u00fea \u00f0e ne willa\u00f0 gelyfan hi swelta\u00f0.\nAnd \u00fea onfeng se ealdormon \u00feane palman and eode in \u00fea ceastre.\n\u00dea gemette he \u00fe\u00e6r micel folc cigendra and cwe\u00feendra, wa us mid micelre blindnesse, we syndon\nHie \u00fea gehirdon word \u00fe\u00e6s ealdormonnes and god gelifdon and \u00fea sona onfengon hi gesyh\u00fee.\nFife \u00feara manna and \u00feuruhwunedon in hira ungeleaffulnesse sona hi w\u00e6ron dea\u00fe sweltende.\nAnd se ealdormon brohte \u00feone palman to \u00feam apostolum and him s\u00e6de ealle \u00fea \u00feing \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r gedon\nAnd \u00f0a apostolas brohton marian lichoman to \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00fee him domine bebead.\nHi hire alegdon in \u00fea byrgenne and mid stane \u00fea byrgene behlidon and \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6t gesetton.\nAnd \u00fea \u00fey \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge on underne com ure h\u00e6lend mid micele engla werode and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam\n\u00dea geb\u00e6don hi him to drihtne and cw\u00e6don, wuldor \u00fee h\u00e6lend \u00feu ana wyrcest micel wuldor.\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 him h\u00e6lend to, hw\u00e6t la, \u00fe